    "causal_summary": "On research runs, a leaf's free text under `## Questions Remaining` becomes a carried-forward question, and `deriveNextFocusFromContinuity` returns the latest one ahead of every machine question, so an iteration's status sentence can become the next focus verbatim (defect D5, parent `research/research.md` §13 and §14)",
